in the term '2017JA' by the Chemistry department (Course 5), show the subject ID, subject title, offering department code, offering department name, number of enrolled students, department full name, school name, and the minimum number of enrolled students over each department code group. Additionally, for each such subject, include the department name and the variance of the total units for subjects offered by that department in the year 2022, but only include departments that grant degrees and exclude the Biology department (Course 7). Order the results by department code and variance of total units in descending order. Do not return any rounded answers."
